$ before <dbl> 35.25, 36.50, 39.75, 39.75, 41.75, 45.00, 47.00, 52.00, 52.00, …
$ after  <dbl> 29.50, 29.50, 36.25, 38.00, 37.50, 42.75, 39.00, 45.25, 52.25, …
```


